:: Fishing Moor Magnet Scrap Catch
<<effects>>
<<if ["sit", "campfire"].includes($daily.fishing.fishingMoor.hikers.phase)>>
	<<fishingMoorMagnetScrapCaughtHikers>>
<<else>>
	<<fishingMoorMagnetScrapCaught>>
<</if>>


:: Widgets Fishing Moor Magnet Catch [widget]
<<widget "fishingMoorMagnetScrapCaught">>
	<<fishingMagnetCatchText $fishingMagnetScrap>>
	You pry it off the magnet and stow it away. You might be able to sell it for scrap.
	<<set $scrapInventory.push($fishingMagnetScrap)>>
	<<run decrementMagnetLoot("fishingMoor")>>
	<<unset $fishingMagnetScrap>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><</link>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "fishingMoorMagnetScrapCaughtHikers">>
	<<fishingMagnetCatchText $fishingMagnetScrap>>
	You pry it off the magnet and stow it away.
	<<set $scrapInventory.push($fishingMagnetScrap)>>
	<<run decrementMagnetLoot("fishingMoor")>>
	<<unset $fishingMagnetScrap>>
	<<if !$daily.fishing.scrapComment>>
		<<set $daily.fishing.scrapComment to true>>
		<br><br>
		One of the hikers nods at what you've hauled up. "You might be able to get something for all that scrap at the scrapyard."
	<<else>>
		You might be able to sell it for scrap.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><</link>>
<</widget>>


:: Fishing Moor Magnet Pull Shovel
<<effects>>
The line goes taut and won't come up. Something is caught on the magnet.
<br><br>

<<link [[Lean back and haul|Fishing Moor Magnet Pull Shovel Haul]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 400 900>>


:: Fishing Moor Magnet Pull Shovel Haul
<<effects>>
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	A rusted garden spade <span class="green">breaks the surface</span>, handle half-rotted, the blade pitted all the way down. It's probably worth something at the scrapyard.
	<<set $scrapInventory.push("shovel")>>
	<<set $fishing.singleCatch.shovel to true>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">Whatever it is, it won't budge.</span> Your rope goes slack as the object slips free from the magnet.<<gtiredness>><<tiredness 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Moor Magnet Pull Bicycle
<<effects>>
The line goes taut and won't come up. Something is caught on the magnet.
<br><br>

<<link [[Lean back and haul|Fishing Moor Magnet Pull Bicycle Haul]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 500 1100>>


:: Fishing Moor Magnet Pull Bicycle Haul
<<effects>>
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	A bicycle frame rises through the murk, front wheel first. You drag it up the bank until it <span class="green">lands in the heather</span>. The frame's bent and one wheel warped out of shape, but it's still probably worth something at the scrapyard.
	<<set $scrapInventory.push("oldBicycle")>>
	<<set $fishing.singleCatch.oldBicycle to true>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">Whatever it is, it won't budge.</span> Your rope goes slack as the object slips free from the magnet.<<gtiredness>><<tiredness 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Moor Magnet Pull Bullet
<<effects>>
The magnet drags up something small and dense. You pry an old bullet off it, the casing green with age. A collector might pay for something like this.
<<museumAntiqueStatus "antiquebullet" "found">>
<<set $antiquemoney += 50>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Moor Magnet Pull Shell
<<effects>>
The magnet comes up heavier than expected. You pry an artillery shell off it, the casing dull green and pitted, a collector might pay well for it.
<<museumAntiqueStatus "antiqueshell" "found">>
<<set $antiquemoney += 100>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><</link>>
